      "created_at": "2017-10-03T14:28:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So much shuffling and reordering done that I am sure I couldn't remake my game if I tried.</p><p>All I know for sure is that Setback ate it early due to holding the Talisman through his turn (Challenge mode hurts) and Kismet's, but the extra card plays he gave to K.N.Y.F.E. managed to mint the day.</p>",
