      "username": "QuirkyDM",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-03T15:31:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Fairly easy mint. Even with me making multiple mistakes, Knyfe and Wraith hammered on Kismet while Naturalist took out most of the ongoings. I felt sure I didn't take advantage of Parse nearly as well as I should have, but it was fairly easy to manage regardless. Everyone was in their mid-teens.</p>",
