      "id": 205316,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-03T18:38:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have never had a challenge with Kismet, and this was no exception.&nbsp; Double Behemoths certainly made things more interesting--I should have guessed that would happen with Rook City Wraith in the game--but I still finished with everyone fairly healthy.&nbsp; It was in the middle of a Predator's Eye round, too, so there was plenty more damage where that came from.&nbsp; Really, any game with Fugue State Parse and Hunted Naturalist is likely to be pretty easy.</p>",
